{"slug":"Universal-Script-Infinite-Yield-95978","_id":"697cedd1c79db56a3046e944","title":"Infinite Yield","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Infinite Yield is a very popular admin command script used in Roblox games.\n\nIt’s a powerful admin panel that lets players use commands (like teleporting, changing walk speed, flying, giving items, etc.) without needing the game creator to set them up — as long as the game allows scripts.\n\n🚀 What Infinite Yield Does\n\nInfinite Yield gives you a command box in games where scripts are allowed, and you can type commands like:\n\n:fly — Make your character fly\n\n:speed 50 — Change your walk/run speed\n\n:teleport playername — Teleport to another player\n\n:bring playername — Bring another player to you\n…and many more.\n\n⚠️ Important: Some commands only work if the game doesn’t block admin scripts, and using admin scripts in games that don’t allow them might get you kicked or banned from that game.\n\n🧠 Where It’s Used\n\nPlayers drop Infinite Yield into games to:\n\nExplore maps fast\n\nMess around with friends\n\nTest stuff\n…but it’s not meant to give unfair advantages in competitive games.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EdgeIY/infiniteyield/master/source'))()","owner":{"_id":"696fb4204f257b2fddd9102d","username":"dom_scripts","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/eb78ac73b7172d2278a3f4690b638c9a6a158c85867bceeb32bb9ec3a486ef88.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696fb4204f257b2fddd9102d-1769794801188.png"},"status":"offline","id":"696fb4204f257b2fddd9102d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.streak","tier":7},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/eb78ac73b7172d2278a3f4690b638c9a6a158c85867bceeb